  nonce: c7d1  # c7d1
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat4/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. 7ed180a2e7 (WI-surun, 2026-08-28) removed the http_client row. erlang.yaml:141-150 records the removal with match evidence (httpc 10/9 vs http_client 0 on ejabberd/emqx), and status is now provenance_declared rather than complete. Sibling check against local OTP 27: code:which found every one of the 26 row modules in erlang.yaml (application ... supervisor); none are missing. MECHANISM: catalogue row names a module that does not exist in the stdlib it claims to enumerate. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gidob. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # c7d1
